<figure class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-2 border-ink p-4 sm:p-6">
  <p class="font-bold">The ladder and barn are measured differently in two frames.</p>
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 300 244"
    class="mx-auto w-full max-w-sm"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="ladder-fig-title ladder-fig-desc"
  >
    <title id="ladder-fig-title">The ladder fits in the barn frame but not in its own</title>
    <desc id="ladder-fig-desc">
      Top: in the barn frame, a 10 metre ladder fits in a 12 metre barn. Bottom: in the ladder
      frame, the ladder is 20 metres and the barn is 6 metres. Door closing times also differ
      between the frames.
    </desc>
    <g fill="currentColor" font-size="17" font-family="sans-serif">
      <text x="12" y="22" font-weight="bold">
        Barn’s frame
      </text>
      <text x="12" y="150" font-weight="bold">
        Ladder’s frame
      </text>
      <text x="12" y="52">
        Barn: 12 m
      </text>
      <text x="12" y="112">
        Ladder: 10 m
      </text>
      <text x="12" y="180">
        Ladder: 20 m
      </text>
      <text x="12" y="234">
        Barn: 6 m
      </text>
    </g>
    <rect
      x="12"
      y="60"
      width="276"
      height="26"
      fill="#d7a13d"
      fill-opacity=".25"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="2"
    />
    <rect x="35" y="68" width="230" height="10" fill="#387a91" />
    <rect
      x="12"
      y="186"
      width="83"
      height="26"
      fill="#d7a13d"
      fill-opacity=".25"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="2"
    />
    <rect x="12" y="194" width="276" height="10" fill="#387a91" />
  </svg>
  <figcaption class="text-base leading-normal">
    At about 0.87 times light speed, the ladder is 10 m in the barn’s frame and fits in its 12 m
    barn. In the ladder’s frame, the barn is just 6 m and the ladder stays 20 m. The missing
    piece is timing: the two doors are not closed simultaneously in the ladder’s frame. Bar
    lengths compare objects <strong>within</strong> each frame, not between the two panels.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
